<title>USA: Reading &amp; Bates restructures credit line.</title>
<headline>Reading &amp; Bates restructures credit line.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Reading &amp; Bates Corp said on Wednesday that it has completed a new $300 million syndicated credit facility, led by Christiana Bank og Kreditkasse.</p>
<p>The new facility replaces the company's prior $140 million credit facility, Reading &amp; Bates said.</p>
<p>Proceeds will be available for debt repayment, working capital and general corporate purposes, the energy services company said.</p>
</text>
